{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Make CCTV in taxis (including private hire taxis) mandatory nationwide",
        "additional_details": "Drivers who refuse to comply with this nationwide law should face a ban from operating.",
        "background": "Given what we feel are increasing risks in society, particularly for women, we believe the Government should prioritise public safety. We want all taxis, including private hire vehicles, to be required by law to have operational CCTV. ",
